{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAL","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"瑪拉基書","commonName":"瑪拉基書","title":"瑪拉基書","order":39,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"d1e7aa60264db53463ef89a9398550f45023f322e82cbb5cd0f0fdc07ab5dc82","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAL/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":55},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「萬軍之耶和華說，『那日要來臨了，就像燒紅的火爐，所有狂妄自大、作惡多端的人都要像碎稭一樣被火燒盡。那將臨之日必焚燒他們，使他們連根帶枝蕩然無存。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["但必有公義的太陽為你們這些敬畏我名的人升起，它的光芒有醫治的能力。你們必像欄中出來的牛犢一樣歡欣跳躍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["到我所定的日子，你們必踐踏惡人，他們必成為你們腳下的塵土。』這是萬軍之耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「你們要銘記我僕人摩西的律法，就是我在何烈山藉著他傳給以色列人的律例和典章。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「看啊，在耶和華那偉大而可畏的日子來臨以前，我必差遣以利亞先知到你們那裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他必使父親的心轉向兒女，兒女的心轉向父親，免得我來徹底毀滅這地方。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAL/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAT/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MAL/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}